{
  "id": "Q3_01_IEKF_natural",
  "caption_en": "Horizontal positioning and heading errors of LegSA-GINS and two-receiver IEKF during nominal walking, large body motion and single-antenna obstruction. The upper and lower rows show horizontal and heading errors, respectively. The two IEKF configurations use literature and calibrated parameters. Gray spans mark the recorded obstruction intervals in the third trial; the insets enlarge the first interval. The dashed black line denotes zero error relative to the reference.",
  "caption_zh": "常规行走、大幅机身运动和单侧天线遮挡实验中，LegSA-GINS与双接收机IEKF的水平定位及航向误差。上、下排分别为水平误差和航向误差；两种IEKF配置分别采用文献参数和标定参数。第三组中的灰带表示天线遮挡时段，小窗放大第一个遮挡时段；黑色虚线表示相对于参考值的零误差。",
  "meaning_zh": "这张图把整体误差大小还原为随机器人运动变化的过程，同时让遮挡期间的细微差别可见。",
